<section class="problem-section">
  <div class="section-label">The Problem</div>
  <h2>AI agents are impulsive.</h2>
  <p class="section-desc">
    They get a task. They execute. No pause. No deliberation. No "should I actually do this?"
  </p>

  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-icon">🔲</div>
      <h3>Blind spots</h3>
      <p>The model doesn't know what it doesn't know. It can't see its own gaps.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-icon">🔄</div>
      <h3>No productive self-debate</h3>
      <p>A single model can't argue with itself. Chain-of-thought is monologue, not dialogue.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-icon">📏</div>
      <h3>Unexamined tradeoffs</h3>
      <p>It won't surface tradeoffs it wasn't prompted to consider. You get what you ask for — nothing more.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-icon">🧠</div>
      <h3>No institutional memory</h3>
      <p>Every decision starts cold. Past mistakes, past wins — all forgotten next time.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem-section {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--red);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .section-desc {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 550px;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .card:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .card-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .card h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
</style>
